# Persistent island record, ported from upstream b2Island in island.h. An
# island is a connected component of awake or sleeping bodies joined by
# touching contacts and joints. Islands use union-find parent links while
# awake, and each solver set stores the island ids that live inside it.
#
# Joint lists exist from the start so Stage 9 slots in without reshaping the
# record; they stay empty until joints land.
Class Island
## Index of the solver set that owns this island. NULL_INDEX when free.
Property SetIndex As Integer
## Island index within its solver set. NULL_INDEX when free.
Property LocalIndex As Integer
## This island's own slot index.
Property IslandId As Integer
## Head of the doubly linked body list.
Property HeadBody As Integer
## Tail of the doubly linked body list.
Property TailBody As Integer
## Number of bodies in the island.
Property BodyCount As Integer
## Head of the doubly linked touching-contact list.
Property HeadContact As Integer
## Tail of the doubly linked touching-contact list.
Property TailContact As Integer
## Number of contacts in the island.
Property ContactCount As Integer
## Head of the doubly linked joint list. Empty until Stage 9.
Property HeadJoint As Integer
## Tail of the doubly linked joint list. Empty until Stage 9.
Property TailJoint As Integer
## Number of joints in the island. Zero until Stage 9.
Property JointCount As Integer
## Union-find parent island id. NULL_INDEX for roots.
Property ParentIsland As Integer
## Number of contacts or joints removed from this island since the last
## split; a nonzero value marks the island as a split candidate.
Property ConstraintRemoveCount As Integer

## Creates a free-record placeholder. Only the world may construct live
## islands; the zero-argument form exists for sparse array capacity.
Constructor()
Me.SetIndex = PhysicsConstants.NULL_INDEX
Me.LocalIndex = PhysicsConstants.NULL_INDEX
Me.IslandId = PhysicsConstants.NULL_INDEX
Me.HeadBody = PhysicsConstants.NULL_INDEX
Me.TailBody = PhysicsConstants.NULL_INDEX
Me.BodyCount = 0
Me.HeadContact = PhysicsConstants.NULL_INDEX
Me.TailContact = PhysicsConstants.NULL_INDEX
Me.ContactCount = 0
Me.HeadJoint = PhysicsConstants.NULL_INDEX
Me.TailJoint = PhysicsConstants.NULL_INDEX
Me.JointCount = 0
Me.ParentIsland = PhysicsConstants.NULL_INDEX
Me.ConstraintRemoveCount = 0
End Constructor
End Class
